  "sublines": [
    "A family of six beavers has been released near Loch Ness, the first recorded there in around 500 years.",
    "Once hunted from the Highlands, beavers now return to shape streams, banks and wetlands around the famous loch.",
    "The release is being called a major milestone for rewilding in Scotland, half a millennium after the species vanished."
